es cheaper public transport  make that direct link between money  they're taking from all their polluting  vehicles and new ideas to make a  transport cleaner and to make it easier  and cheaper then people might be more  supportive but as I say the bigger the  area gets the more that link is broken  and the more it's more difficult for  people to actually give up their  vehicles okay Neil Greg Quentin Wilson  it's been a pleasure speaking to you  both thank you for joining us today on  the climate show  foreign  now and a reminder you can watch Tom  heaps climate show on Saturdays and  Sundays that's at 3 30 in the afternoon  or at 7 30 in the evening but for now  that is all from us for today we'll see  you again at the same time tomorrow  thanks very much for watching see you  then

